<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292e80;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e880;">├─ </span><span style="--shiki-light:#959da5;--shiki-dark:#959da5;">integrators</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#28a745;--shiki-dark:#34d058;">SciML, SciML</span></span>
